 {"text": "18 days", "added": false}, {"text": "8 days", "added": false}, {"text": "15 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "group-work", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "The average marks of three classes of 50, 65 and 45 students, respectively, are 75, 80 and 90. Find the average marks of all the students.", "options": [{"text": "91.65", "added": false}, {"text": "81.25", "added": false}, {"text": "75.81", "added": false}, {"text": "71.65", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "weighted-average", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "A device is available for ₹8,000 cash or ₹500 down payment followed by four equal monthly instalments. If the rate of simple interest charged is 25% per annum, then find the instalment, to the nearest rupee.", "options": [{"text": "₹1,977", "added": false}, {"text": "₹1,987", "added": false}, {"text": "₹1,970", "added": false}, {"text": "₹1,790", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-instalments", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "Which of the following numbers is NOT a prime number?", "options": [{"text": "1571", "added": false}, {"text": "1471", "added": false}, {"text": "1271", "added": false}, {"text": "1171", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "types-of-numbers", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "The cost price of an item is one-fourth of its selling price. What is the gain or loss percentage on that item?", "options": [{"text": "Gain of 300%", "added": false}, {"text": "Loss of 100%", "added": false}, {"text": "Gain of 100%", "added": false}, {"text": "Loss of 300%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "The sum of five consecutive integers is 235. Which of